                                        <desc language="en-US">SHOULD contain zero or one [0..1] @use, which SHALL be selected from ValueSet PostalAddressUse urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.1.11.10637 STATIC 2005-05-01 (CONF:81-7290).</desc>
